  "shortDescription": "Siem Reap3天游览，含Day-1 Sunrise on Angkor Wat和Day-2 Grand Tour and Banteay Srei Temple and Day-3 Rolus Group and Tonle Sab Lake。直接向Private Siem Reap Tour Guide & Transport订位，而非通过分销商。",
