  "shortDescription": "Siem Reap1天游览，含Old Market、Local food and night market Siem Reap和ចែសា ម្ហូបកម្ម៉ង់ទល់ភ្លឺ and Yi Nget BBQ Beef Sticks。直接向About Cambodia Travel and Tours订位，而非通过分销商。",
