  "shortDescription": "20天的Ho Chi Minh City游览，含Evening | Begin Your Vietnam Adventure及Morning | Welcome to the Mountains and Morning | Trek Through Muong Hoa Valley。运营商：CÔNG TY TNHH MTV GO VIETNAM TRIP HÀ NỘI，直接预订而非通过转售商预订。",
